This directory contains two font families, patched for 0WM:
- Noto Sans (`NotoSans-0WM-Regular.woff2` and `NotoSans-0WM-Italic.woff2`), licensed under the terms laid out in `OFL-NotoSans.txt`,
- Roboto Mono (`RobotoMono-0WM-Regular.woff2` and `RobotoMono-0WM-Italic.woff2`), licensed under the terms laid out in `OFL-RobotoMono.txt`.

Noto Sans is patched with `pyftfeatfreeze` to use the `zero` variant.
Both fonts are patched with `pyftsubset` to only include characters within the ranges U+0000–0017F and U+2000–206F.
